NEW COURSE ENROLLMENT

Hi {{#if user_first_name}}{{user_first_name}}{{else}}{{user_name}}{{/if}},

{{#if was_enrolled_by_someone}}
{{enrolled_by}} has enrolled you in a new course!
{{else}}
You've been successfully enrolled in a new course!
{{/if}}

{{#if is_part_of_path}}
This course is part of the {{learning_path_name}} learning path.
{{/if}}

COURSE: {{course_name}}
{{#if course_description}}
{{course_description}}
{{/if}}

{{#if instructor_name}}Instructor: {{instructor_name}}{{/if}}
{{#if duration}}Duration: {{duration}}{{/if}}
{{#if has_dates}}
Start Date: {{start_date}}
{{#if end_date}}End Date: {{end_date}}{{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{#if has_prerequisites}}
PREREQUISITES
Before starting this course, please complete the following:
{{#each prerequisites}}
- {{this}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

Start learning now: {{course_url}}

WHAT TO EXPECT
- Access to all course materials and resources
- Interactive lessons and assessments
- Track your progress as you complete modules
- Earn a certificate upon completion

We're excited for you to start this learning journey!

Best regards,
The {{organization_name}} Team
"#;
